..!interpreter english noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : DISPLAY.EDI2IHSS
.. Author         : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : dsch
.. Functionality  : Display edi message in text bos.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue END  ?  G|argc<=1
.continue END  ?  F|empty(G|arg1)
..
.. Argument 1 must be an edi message
.type P53  edi
.assign U|edi = G|arg1
.continue END  ? _G|mehr
..
.. Argument 2 might be a file name
.type text output
.formula U|output = G|arg2 ? G|argc>2
..
.. Display (or print to file)
.select edifact 'U|edi^id'
.continue END  ? _G|mehr
.output terminal
.output new 'U|output' ? _F|empty(U|output)
.input "DATEI.F"
.input "dfue/DFUE.EXP.EDI2IHS"

.. finish with empty line
.output terminal
.select -
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue

